argin: 0.0px 0.0px 0.0px 0.0px; font: 12.0px Helvetica\"&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1634285,"PostDate":1340416623,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> I posted in the other boarding pass forum but then realized it wasnt the DIY one. \u00a0<\/p> <p> So here it goes again :-)\u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p id=\"yui_3_4_1_1_1340415566487_725\"  style=\"margin-left: 0px\"> With all the help and inspiration i got from everyone on here i figured it was only right that i share what i came up with.<\/p> <p id=\"yui_3_4_1_1_1340415566487_723\"  style=\"margin-left: 0px\"> For boarding pass and ceremony fans i used aylee bit template\u00a0<\/p> <p id=\"yui_3_4_1_1_1340415566487_721\"  style=\"margin-left: 0px\"> All clip art came from dafont.com<\/p> <p id=\"yui_3_4_1_1_1340415566487_719\"  style=\"margin-left: 0px\"> \u00a0<\/p> <p id=\"yui_3_4_1_1_1340415566487_727\"  style=\"margin-left: 0px\"> MATERIALS<\/p> <p id=\"yui_3_4_1_1_1340415566487_717\"  style=\"margin-left: 0px\"> Envelope liners - wedding themed wrapping paper (walmart)<\/p> <p id=\"yui_3_4_1_1_1340415566487_715\"  style=\"margin-left: 0px\"> Wrap around labels - ivory cardstock, stamp \u00a0(michaels)\u00a0<\/p> <p id=\"yui_3_4_1_1_1340415566487_713\"  style=\"margin-left: 0px\"> \u00a0<\/p> <p id=\"yui_3_4_1_1_1340415566487_729\"  style=\"margin-left: 0px\"> Boarding Passes - Metallic Cream Linen Cardstock (paperandmore)\u00a0<\/p> <p id=\"yui_3_4_1_1_1340415566487_711\"  style=\"margin-left: 0px\"> Ticket Jackets and Ceremony Programs \u00a0- Metallic Lagoon Cardstock (paperandmore)<\/p> <p id=\"yui_3_4_1_1_1340415566487_709\"  style=\"margin-left: 0px\"> Envelopes - Metallic Bronze #10 and Metallic Lagoon 4 bar (envelopemall)<\/p> <p id=\"yui_3_4_1_1_1340415566487_707\"  style=\"margin-left: 0px\"> \u00a0<\/p> <p id=\"yui_3_4_1_1_1340415566487_705\"  style=\"margin-left: 0px\"> <spanid=\"yui_3_4_1_1_1340415566487_731\" >PIcked up at Michaels<\/span><\/p> <p id=\"yui_3_4_1_1_1340415566487_733\"  style=\"margin-left: 0px\"> Rotary Trimmer<\/p> <p id=\"yui_3_4_1_1_1340415566487_735\"  style=\"margin-left: 0px\"> 1\/8 Hole punch<\/p> <p id=\"yui_3_4_1_1_1340415566487_737\"  style=\"margin-left: 0px\"> Sand Dollar\/Starfish Punch<\/p> <p id=\"yui_3_4_1_1_1340415566487_739\"  style=\"margin-left: 0px\"> Rounded Corner Punch<\/p> <p id=\"yui_3_4_1_1_1340415566487_741\"  style=\"margin-left: 0px\"> Scissors<\/p> <p id=\"yui_3_4_1_1_1340415566487_743\"  style=\"margin-left: 0px\"> Zots glue dots<\/p> <p id=\"yui_3_4_1_1_1340415566487_745\"  style=\"margin-left: 0px\"> Bone folder<\/p> <p id=\"yui_3_4_1_1_1340415566487_747\"  style=\"margin-left: 0px\"> aqua ribbon<\/p> <p id=\"yui_3_4_1_1_1340415566487_749\"  style=\"margin-left: 0px\"> Bronze brads<\/p> <p  style=\"margin-left: 0px\"> \u00a0<\/p> <p  style=\"margin-left: 0px\"> BOARDING PASS INVITES\/JACKETS\/RETURNTICKETS\/WRAP AROUND ADDRESS LABELS<\/p> <p  style=\"margin-left: 0px\"> \u00a0<\/p> <p  style=\"margin-left: 0px\"> \u00a0<\/p> <p  style=\"margin: 0.0px 0.0px 0.0px 0.0px\"> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"DSC00087.JPG\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/873596\/width\/525\/height\/700\" \/><\/span><\/p> <p  style=\"margin: 0.0px 0.0px 0.0px 0.0px\"> \u00a0<\/p> <p  style=\"margin: 0.0px 0.0px 0.0px 0.0px\"> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"DSC00089.JPG\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/873598\/width\/600\/height\/450\" \/><\/span><\/p> <p  style=\"margin: 0.0px 0.0px 0.0px 0.0px\"> \u00a0<\/p> <p  style